+- Freezing a project (`POST /projects/{pid}/freeze`) is a manager-only write
+  (other roles 403, archived 409). It changes every member's role to `viewer`
+  (managers included) and clears the assignee of every task in the project.
+  Afterwards nobody can change the project's tasks. Reads still work.
